[node name="TutorialText" type="RichTextLabel" parent="BriefingPanel"]
layout_mode = 0
anchors_preset = 15
anchor_right = 1.0
anchor_bottom = 1.0
grow_horizontal = 2
grow_vertical = 2
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.84, 0.91, 0.96, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=24][color=#eef7ff]MISSION[/color][/font_size]
Climate disasters are spreading across the crisis map. Your relief teams must deliver the correct aid before instability becomes uncontrollable.

[font_size=24][color=#eef7ff]HOW TO PLAY[/color][/font_size]
Roll to move your team around the board.
Land on crisis tiles to respond.
Use the correct aid type to reduce or clear the crisis.

[font_size=24][color=#eef7ff]AID MATCHES[/color][/font_size]
Flood -> Water Rescue
Wildfire -> Fire Response
Medical -> Medical Supplies
Infrastructure -> Repair Team
Food Shortage -> Food Aid

[font_size=24][color=#eef7ff]QUANTUM TOOLS[/color][/font_size]
Use quantum abilities to predict, boost, or alter movement. These tools can help, but instability can still rise.

[font_size=24][color=#eef7ff]WIN CONDITION[/color][/font_size]
Stabilize as many crises as possible before the world reaches critical instability."

